@wolfpage_api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5141

### Crear workspace
POST {{wolfpage_api_HostAddress}}/api/workspaces
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mi Negocio",
  "email": "demo@minegocio.com",
  "workspaceType": "Business",
  "profileType": "Business"
}

### Listar workspaces
GET {{wolfpage_api_HostAddress}}/api/workspaces
Accept: application/json

### Listar templates publicados
GET {{wolfpage_api_HostAddress}}/api/templates
Accept: application/json

### Generar página (publica mensaje al Worker)
POST {{wolfpage_api_HostAddress}}/api/pages/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workspaceId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "templateVersionId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "pageName": "Página de inicio",
  "slug": "pagina-de-inicio",
  "content": {
    "title": "Bienvenido",
    "subtitle": "Demo del generador"
  }
}

### Consultar estado de la solicitud
GET {{wolfpage_api_HostAddress}}/api/pages/requests/{requestId}
Accept: application/json

### Obtener página generada
GET {{wolfpage_api_HostAddress}}/api/pages/{pageId}
Accept: application/json
